   "identifier": "mikan-genome",
   "description": "Public PacBio HiFi data now covers 18 citrus cultivars including Satsuma mandarin, Iyokan, Hassaku, Hyuganatsu, Ponkan and orange, and 2026 resources make haplotype-resolved, allele-level work possible. Can that data support a Japanese citrus pangenome that explains what makes each variety different?",
